Subject: feat(library): let users tag saved CVs
Description:
  Adds a `cv_tags` table so a user can label saved CVs ("remote", "junior", "pl")
  and filter the library by tag. Owner id comes from the verified session as
  everywhere else; the repository filters by `user_id` on every query. Types
  regenerated with `npm run db:types`.

